{"id":"146be3a41dc20483","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-interpolation.md","title":"Interpolation","display":"df-interpolation — Interpolation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-interpolation","aliases":["93-df-interpolation"],"display":"df-interpolation — Interpolation","depends_on":["[[93-df-craig-interpolation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-interpolation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-interpolation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-interpolation — Interpolation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eda3df85f724c1ae\" href=\"?note=eda3df85f724c1ae\" title=\"93-df-craig-interpolation\">93-df-craig-interpolation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> (a logic and its connective type in the scope of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"eda3df85f724c1ae\" href=\"?note=eda3df85f724c1ae\" title=\"93-df-craig-interpolation\">93-df-craig-interpolation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}\\)</span> (Craig-interpolation predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Interpolation}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Interpolation}_{93}\\)</span> (synonymous interpolation predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interpolation} \\vdash \\mathrm{Interpolation}_{93}(\\mathcal L;\\tau_{\\mathcal L}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathcal L;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interpolation} \\vdash \\mathrm{Interpolation}_{93}(\\mathcal L;\\tau_{\\mathcal L}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathcal L;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>No nonempty-common-variable premise is imposed: when the endpoint formulas share no variables, an interpolant—if it exists—must be variable-free.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-craig-interpolation","status":"resolved","id":"eda3df85f724c1ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-craig-interpolation]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-craig-interpolation","status":"resolved","id":"eda3df85f724c1ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L$ and $\\tau_{\\mathcal L}$ (a logic and its connective type in the scope of [[93-df-craig-interpolation]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Interpolation}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interpolation} \\vdash \\mathrm{Interpolation}_{93}(\\mathcal L;\\tau_{\\mathcal L}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathcal L;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})","display":true}],"bytes":891,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["eda3df85f724c1ae"]}